# The web end-to-end suite is test infrastructure and never ships in an image.
# Some of its harness specs import other apps' sources on purpose (one reads the
# API's platform catalog rules), and the pruned web build context
# (`turbo prune --scope=ever-works-web --docker`) does not contain those apps,
# so `next build` failed its type check inside the image build. The full
# checkout still type-checks the suite: `next build` in CI covers `apps/web/**`.
apps/web/e2e
